y doesn't trigger abilities of permanents named Psychic Battle.", 'Whenever a player kicks a spell, you create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'Whenever a player taps a land for mana, that player adds one mana of any type that land produced, and Overabundance deals 1 damage to the player.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a multicolored spell, you gain 4 life.', 'White spells you cast cost {W} more to cast.', "Yavimaya Kavu's power is equal to the number of red creatures on the battlefield.\\nYavimaya Kavu's toughness is equal to the number of green creatures on the battlefield.", "You and target spell's controller bid life. You start the bidding with a bid of 1. In turn order, each player may top the high bid. The bidding ends if the high bid stands. The high bidder loses life equal to the high bid. If you win the bidding, counter that spell.", "You can't cast more than one spell each turn.\\nYou may play lands and cast spells from your graveyard.\\nIf a card would be put into your graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead.", 'You gain 3 life.\\nDraw a card.', 'You may cast Breaking Wave as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it. (You may cast it any time you could cast an instant.)\\nSimultaneously untap all tapped creatures and tap all untapped creatures.', 'You may cast Ghitu Fire as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it. (You may cast it any time you could cast an instant.)\\nGhitu Fire deals X damage to any target.', "You may cast Rout as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it. (You may cast it any time you could cast an instant.)\\nDestroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'You may cast Saproling Symbiosis as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it. (You may cast it any time you could cast an instant.)\\nCreate a 1/1 green Saproling creature token for each creature you control.', "You may cast Twilight's Call as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it. (You may cast it any time you could cast an instant.)\\nEach player returns all creature cards from their graveyard to the battlefield.", 'You win the game if you control a land of each basic land type and a creature of each color.', "Your opponents play with their hands revealed.\\nSacrifice Seer's Vision: Look at target player's hand and choose a card from it. That player discards that card. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Zap deals 1 damage to any target.\\nDraw a card.', '{1}, Pay 1 life: Prevent all damage that would be dealt to you this turn by a source of your choice that shares a color with the mana spent on this activation cost. (Colorless mana prevents no damage.)', '{1}, Pay 2 life: Reckless Assault deals 1 damage to any target.', "{1}, Sacrifice Crosis's Attendant: Add {U}{B}{R}.", "{1}, Sacrifice Darigaaz's Attendant: Add {B}{R}{G}.", "{1}, Sacrifice Dromar's Attendant: Add {W}{U}{B}.", "{1}, Sacrifice Rith's Attendant: Add {R}{G}{W}.", "{1}, Sacrifice Treva's Attendant: Add {G}{W}{U}.", '{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Chromatic Sphere: Add one mana of any color. Draw a card.', '{1}: Add {B}.', '{1}: Noble Panther gains first strike until end of turn.', '{1}{B}: Regenerate Goham Djinn.\\nGoham Djinn gets -2/-2 as long as black is the most common color among all permanents or is tied for most common.', '{1}{G}: Add one mana of any color.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target nonbasic land.', "{1}{R}{G}, {T}: Exile Hunting Kavu and target creature without flying that's attacking you.", '{1}{U}: Target spell or permanent becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{1}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Capashen Unicorn: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', '{1}{W}{U}, {T}: Return target artifact or enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', "{1}{W}{W}: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\n{1}{U}{U}: Armored Guardian gains shroud until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", '{2}: Ancient Kavu becomes colorless until end of turn.', '{2}: Target black or green creature gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', '{2}: Target blue or red creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{2}: Target green or blue creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', "{2}: Target red or white creature gains trample until end of turn. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "{2}: Target white or black creature gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", '{2}{B}, {T}: Target player discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{2}{R}, {T}: Destroy target nonbasic land.', '{2}{R}{G}, Discard two cards at random: Meteor Storm deals 4 damage to any target.', '{2}{U}{U}: Exchange control of Phyrexian Infiltrator and target creature. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', '{2}{W}, {T}: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{3}{U}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{3}{U}, {T}: Tap target creature.\\n{3}{B}, {T}: Destroy target tapped creature.', '{6}, {T}: Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', '{B}, {T}: Target player loses 1 life.\\n{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Cinder Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n{R}, Sacrifice Cinder Shade: It deals damage equal to its power to target creature.', "{B}: Hooded Kavu gains fear until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", '{B}: Regenerate Metathran Zombie.', '{B}{B}, {T}: Target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\n{G}{G}, {T}: Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.', "{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n{U}, {T}: Put target creature you control on top of its owner's library.", '{G}, {T}: You may put a basic land card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{G}: Target creature blocks Rampant Elephant this turn if able.', '{G}: Viashino Grappler gains trample until end of turn.', "{G}{G}, {T}: Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.\\n{U}{U}, {T}: Return target creature to its owner's hand.", '{R}, {T}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.\\n{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{R}: Firescreamer gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{R}: Serpentine Kavu gains haste until end of turn.', '{R}{R}, {T}: Thornscape Master deals 2 damage to target creature.\\n{W}{W}, {T}: Target creature gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Keldon Necropolis deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Archaeological Dig: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', '{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', '{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', '{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', "{T}: Destroy target creature if it shares a color with the most common color among all permanents or a color tied for most common. A creature destroyed this way can't be regenerated.", '{T}: Llanowar Vanguard gets +0/+4 until end of turn.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.\\n{T}: Samite Archer deals 1 damage to any target.', '{T}: Search your library for a legendary card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{T}: Target creature becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: Target land becomes a Swamp until end of turn.', "{U}, {T}: Put target creature you control on top of its owner's library.\\n{R}, {T}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.", '{U}{U}, {T}: Gain control of target legendary permanent. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', "{U}{U}, {T}: Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\n{R}{R}, {T}: Nightscape Master deals 2 damage to target creature.", '{W}, Sacrifice an enchantment: Destroy target enchantment.\\n{3}{U}{U}: Counter target enchantment spell.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.\\n{B}, {T}: Target player loses 1 life.', '{W}: Llanowar Cavalry gains vigilance until end of turn.', '{W}{W}, {T}: Target creature gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\n{B}{B}, {T}: Target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', '{X}, {T}: Choose one —\\n• Prevent the next X damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn. Spend only white mana on X.\\n• You gain X life. Spend only white mana on X.']
flavor: ['"A strange skull was turned up by an Ephran farmer\'s plow. I traded a copper ring for the \'ox skull.\' It resonates of the sea and danger."\\n—Isel, master carver', '"Above the waves you may be mighty indeed, but down here you belong to me."', '"All my life I\'ve fought these monsters. Today I finish that fight."\\n—Barrin', '"All that matters is the path ahead."', '"All this time I thought Squee was useless," chuckled Sisay. "Who knew he\'d be such a good shot?"', '"An elvish adventurer unearthed this stone in Jolrael\'s jungle. Now it\'s truly fit for display in one of her palaces."\\n—Isel, master carver', '"Are they on our side?" asked Sisay. "If they kill Phyrexians they are," replied Gerrard.', '"At least they remember me."\\n—Gerrard', '"Beneath her scars, Dominaria\'s beauty yet shines."\\n—Multani, maro-sorcerer', '"Birds reach all parts of the world," said Barrin. "They will make excellent scouts."', '"Breathe deep, Dominaria. Breathe deep and die."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc, Phyrexian general', '"Crosis is the eye of the ur-dragon, piercing illusion and darkness."', '"Darigaaz is the breath of the ur-dragon, burning away the burdens of mortality."', '"Death is such an exquisite sensation."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc, Phyrexian general', '"Deceit is the heart of war."', '"Do griffins fight to defend their homes or purely for sport?"\\n—Sisay', '"Dominaria touches us all."\\n—Molimo, maro-sorcerer', '"Don\'t laugh. It works."\\n—Yavimaya ranger', '"Dromar is the wings of the ur-dragon, sweeping away all opposition."', '"Every last one of you will become my servant. It\'s a shame you won\'t live to see the irony."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc, Phyrexian general', '"Everything is in place. Nothing can happen that isn\'t part of my plan."\\n—Urza', '"Fire is the universal language."\\n—Jhoira, master artificer', '"For what are leaves but countless blades\\nTo fight a countless foe on high."\\n—Skyshroud hymn', '"Forget it. I\'m not getting up today."', '"From shards and splinters I call forth my living horde."\\n—Molimo, maro-sorcerer', '"Gaea\'s memory is eternal, and she exists in all things."\\n—Molimo, maro-sorcerer', '"Great peril demands formidable weaponry."\\n—Urza', '"Hanna would give up her own life before she\'d abandon the *Weatherlight*."\\n—Sisay', '"Healing is a gift the divine ones have shared with us. It is a sacred trust."', '"How will you fight an enemy that cares nothing for itself?"\\n—The Blind Seer', '"I can preserve ten lives by taking one."', '"I can\'t imagine how anyone lives in Shiv, let alone why they choose to stay."\\n—Sisay', '"I don\'t have time for you right now."\\n—Teferi', '"I found a troll-horn fragment in the wooded foothills of Hurloon, and it keeps growing larger. I wonder, is the horn recreating itself or the troll?"\\n—Isel, master carver', '"I have chosen my path. Who will walk it with me?"\\n—Eladamri', '"I knew this day would come," said Urza. Looking at the destruction, Barrin sighed, "You don\'t have to revel in it."', '"I know how this one feels," said Urza. "It\'s not like others of its kind and has been shunned for its differences."', '"I might almost pity my enemies—if it wasn\'t so amusing to watch them die."', '"I never thought I\'d spend my life fighting. I\'m a maker, not a destroyer."', '"I suggest you take a closer look."\\n—Tidal visionary', '"I think he sees more than he lets on."\\n—Gerrard', '"I think she wants us to eat it," said Squee, staring at the oily carcass the cheetah had dragged to their fire.', '"I\'d strip away the world to see what\'s under it, but I\'d never just leave it to these Phyrexian parasites and their false god."\\n—Urborg witch', '"I\'ll wring out your tiny mind like a sponge."\\n—Urborg witch', '"I\'m up here. You\'re down there. Now who\'s the lower life form?"', '"I\'ve journeyed across Dominaria. Phyrexians are everywhere. Plague is everywhere. There\'s no place left to hide."', '"If I do nothing else, I will protect my people."\\n—Teferi', '"If only an angel\'s wings could shelter us all."\\n—Barrin', '"In times like these, people need to be reminded of compassion."\\n—Sisay', '"Isn\'t he on our side?"\\n"Yep."\\n"Why\'s he spyin\' on us?"\\n"Don\'t ask."', '"Isolation is not the answer."\\n—Urza, to Teferi', '"It could be worse," said Gerrard, looking around. "Well, maybe not."', '"It is Yawgmoth\'s will incarnate: an efficient machine that replaces inefficient flesh."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc', '"It took magic to extract one of the stones and five people to carry it."\\n—Tolarian research notes', '"It\'s a tool for aiding my other tools," explained Urza. "Now they\'ll work in harmony."', '"Its gems didn\'t stop pulsating until they were completely removed."\\n—Tolarian research notes', '"Its stones seem to serve a healing function, but removing them intact is an exhausting process."\\n—Tolarian research notes', '"Let insight and energy be your guides."\\n—The Blind Seer, to Gerrard', '"Let my hate fuel your fury."', '"Let my hope be your shield."', '"Let my passion spur your victory."', '"Let my strength harden your resolve."', '"Let my wisdom give you wings."', '"Life can be found in all things, even things unnatural."\\n—Multani, maro-sorcerer', '"My army took centuries to gather," remarked Urza. "Yavimaya seems to conjure hers out of thin air."', '"My only dream is to destroy the nightmares of others."', '"No, *you* get the water. I ain\'t thirsty."\\n—Squee', '"Not everyone gets a second chance."\\n—Hanna', '"Older specimens are completely encrusted with gems, which serve as both armor and weapons."\\n—Tolarian research notes', '"Only vengeance matters now."\\n—Barrin', '"Our victory must come from all of Dominaria, or it will not come."\\n—Urza', '"Part drill sergeant, part training dummy," thought Gerrard. "I hope it can stand up to a real war."', '"Remember me?" Tahngarth roared. "Now I\'ll repay you for my stay on Rath!"', '"Rest now. You\'ve neither won nor lost, but this battle is over for you just the same."\\n—Teferi', '"Rise, metathran. You shall serve a nobler cause in death."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc, Phyrexian general', '"Rith is the claw of the ur-dragon, scattering seeds of devastation."', '"Serra\'s light isn\'t easily extinguished."\\n—Reya Dawnbringer', '"Strength in numbers? I think not."\\n—Gerrard', '"The Phyrexians have progressed," admired Urza. "Their parts are interchangeable."', '"The battlefield is cluttered enough. Be still."\\n—Multani, maro-sorcerer', '"The blood of your ancestors ran heavy on this soil. Now it\'s your turn to sacrifice for the glory of Shiv."\\n—Viashino heretic', '"The earth shook, the sky rained fire, and it seemed the world was ending."\\n—Benalish refugee', '"The invasion has awoken slumbering mountains," noted Urza. "Good. We can use all the help we can get."', '"The mongoose blew out its candle and was asleep in bed before the room went dark."\\n—Llanowar fable', '"The stone whispers to me of dragon\'s fire and darkness. I wish I\'d never pried it from the figurehead of that sunken Keldon longship."\\n—Isel, master carver', '"The subject\'s wings are clearly vestigial. We suspect the gems somehow keep it aloft."\\n—Tolarian research notes', '"The world calls and I answer."', '"Their arrival marks the end of Yawgmoth\'s subtlety."\\n—Urza', '"There\'s nothing I wouldn\'t give to achieve victory. Can you say the same?"\\n—Tsabo Tavoc, to Gerrard', '"They certainly are well protected. Too bad for them they\'re not well balanced."\\n—Sisay', '"They ride our trails as if they were designed to," said the guard. "They were," replied Gerrard.', '"They weren\'t part of my plan, but Gaea insisted."\\n—Urza', '"They\'ve returned for the mana rig, but it no longer belongs to them."\\n—Viashino bey', '"Think of the problems we\'ll face if you uproot entire continents," said Urza.\\n"I have," replied Teferi, "but the alternative is worse."', '"This is a battle of pawns, for the highest stakes imaginable."\\n—Urza', '"This strange new beast makes for an excellent meal. Get me more."\\n—Empress Galina', '"Those who can\'t survive are of no consequence."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc', '"Those who know only one path to victory can never hope to triumph."\\n—The Blind Seer', '"Today a seashell fell from the empty sky here in Kinymu, a hundred leagues from the sea. I\'m torn—shall I carve a woman or a bird?"\\n—Isel, master carver', '"Treva is the voice of the ur-dragon, demanding cries of worship."', '"Urborg\'s magic is strong. Did Urza send you to protect us or to protect against us?"\\n—Urborg witch, to Barrin', '"We define the boundaries of reality; they don\'t define us."\\n—Teferi', '"We hid such stockpiles all over Rath. We should continue that practice here."\\n—Lin Sivvi', '"We need alternatives, Hanna," yelled Gerrard. "Now!"', '"We turned old weapons into new warriors."\\n—Jhoira, master artificer', '"We turned to see where the blow came from and saw only a distant light."\\n—Capashen lord', '"Whatever Yawgmoth marks, dies. There is no escape."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc, Phyrexian general', '"Which would you like first, the insult or the injury?"', '"Will history remember this as the day demons arrived or the day saviors arrived?"\\n—Barrin', '"Wings are but fins for swimming the sky."\\n—Empress Galina', '"You aren\'t invited."', '"You can build a perfect machine out of imperfect parts."\\n—Urza', '"You helped save my people from a Phyrexian fate. Did you think I wouldn\'t return the favor?"\\n—Eladamri, to Gerrard', '"You think you can stop me?" hissed Tsabo. "I think I can kill you," replied Gerrard.', '"Your life was meaningless, but your death will glorify Yawgmoth."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc', '"Your presumption is your downfall."', 'A beacon of hope for a battered army.', 'A chilling fog with teeth of ice.', 'A skilled ranger can glance at the mud on your boots and tell where you last camped.', 'A writhing mass of rot, with sharp claws and a vicious spirit.', 'After encountering them, Squee finally lost his appetite for bugs.', 'All Dominarians agreed on one thing: they would not go down without a fight.', 'All elvenkind stood against Phyrexia. The Quirion nation deployed its most spiritual adepts, who wielded the power of their native soil.', "An angel's sword impales only the body; her righteousness penetrates the soul.", 'Anything sent into a plagued world is bound to come back infected.', "As Barrin exhumed his daughter's body, he finally realized the full price of his faith in Urza.", 'As Phyrexians descended, Multani paused to reflect on the beauty that might never be seen again.', 'As a dark rain of Phyrexians fell from the sky, fountains of kavu erupted from the ground.', 'As battle raged in Shiv, a strange new ally appeared from below the ravaged ground.', 'As healers battled each plague, they learned more about the next.', 'Barbarians long for a glorious death in battle. Phyrexia was eager to grant that wish.', 'Barrin waited for the nausea to pass or for Urza to say something else. He waited in vain.', "Benalia was only the first nation victimized by Tsabo Tavoc's specialized killers.", 'Beneath the waves, things appear the way merfolk want them to.', 'Broken and punctured by dozens of Phyrexian portals, the angry sky began to spit lightning back at the world.', 'Capashen riders were stern and humorless even before their ancestral home was reduced to rubble.', 'Children claim no two feathers are exactly the same color, then eagerly gather them for proof.', 'Darigaaz decided his foe would be more useful as a weapon.', "Death's embrace need not be cold.", 'Deep in the heart of Urborg lie massive volcanoes whose thick black smoke covers the land with perpetual darkness.', 'Dominarians gladly fought alongside kavu . . . until the kavu figured out some Dominarians were quite tasty.', 'Fierce when roused, this breed of kavu is easily distracted by a strong voice or melodic tune.', 'For his family, Barrin made a funeral pyre of Tolaria.', 'For the first time, elves welcomed Benalish soldiers into the forest with something other than arrows.', "Fouler than a necromancer's kiss.\\n—Jamuraan expression", 'Gaea battles rampant death with abundant life.', 'Gaea forged her soldiers into self-wielding weapons that struck down all impurities.', 'Gerrard savored a grim smile as the Phyrexian portals disappeared behind the *Weatherlight*.', 'Her armor and steed were borrowed, but her courage was hers alone.', "Her leadership forged the *Weatherlight*'s finest crew.", 'Hot wind whipped up as if the weather itself wanted to fight Phyrexians.', 'In Yavimaya, flying low to join a battle can be a costly mistake.', "In the dark, it's nearly invisible—until it exhales.", 'It desires only to help others shed the itchy wet skin of life.', 'It sleeps with its claws open.', 'It took Yavimaya a thousand years to breed them, but it took only seconds for them to prove their worth.', 'It winds its way through undergrowth as easily as it swims through shallows.', "It's not eager to lose the *other* eye.", 'Its slime liquefies the ground as efficiently as its fangs shred prey.', 'Its stature and stride increase with each step it takes.', 'Kavu emerged all across Dominaria, but the first and the strongest came from Yavimaya.', 'Kavu hunt prey in packs—one kavu hunts a pack of prey.', 'Llanowar forges weapons of steel. Yavimaya grows her weapons within.', 'Llanowar has seven elfhames, or kingdoms, each with its own ruler. Their palaces are objects of awe, wonder, and envy.', "Llanowar rallied around Eladamri's banner and united in his name.", 'Lotus fields are too valuable to leave undefended.', 'Misery, filth, disease—all things that bring suffering to the world—only make Phyrexians more dangerous.', 'No matter how righteous the cause, it helps to bring along some muscle.', 'No spot in nature is truly barren.', "Not all elves embrace the pastoral life. Some still roam the forest's edge, forever making war against their hated enemies.", 'Not choosing sides in a war can be dangerous—but lucrative.', 'Nothing is sacred to the rats. Everything is simply another meal.', 'Once an angel, now an abomination.', 'Only death breeds in stagnant water.\\n—Urborg saying', 'Only the hardiest explorers survive to eat the fruit.', 'Protected by druids for untold centuries, the forest began to return the favor.', 'Relentless as the sea, remorseless as death.', 'Serra\'s living warriors looked on in horror. "Where is our Lady now?" they cried.', "Teferi wanted no part of Urza's battle plans, but both agreed the Phyrexian portal must be closed.", 'The Capashen built the highest towers in Benalia to afford themselves the best view.', "The appearance of the first kavu surprised Multani. As they continued to emerge, he no longer had any doubts about Yavimaya's ability to defend herself.", 'The cruelest strain of plague keeps its hosts alive long enough to return home and infect their families.', 'The detailed dispatch could be summarized in four words: "Time is running out."', 'The faithful will walk through streams of fire and emerge unscathed.\\n—Crimson acolyte creed', 'The fruit of this fabled tree takes on the flavor of whatever food you love most.', 'The kavu evolved for centuries deep inside Dominaria, and some can draw from its strength.', 'The plague moved faster than an army and was far more deadly.', 'The plagues robbed Dominaria of all but its dreams. Eladamri hoped dreams were enough.', 'The power of the wild, concentrated in a single charge.', 'The sky split, and the air crackled and roiled. The Phyrexian invasion of Dominaria had finally begun.', 'The spread of its hood eclipses all hope.', "The storm wasn't an omen. It was the fulfillment of one.", 'The truthful will stand in the gaze of death and escape unharmed.\\n—Obsidian acolyte creed', "There's no known antidote for the cobra's venom . . . or its appetite.", 'They sneer at the terrestrial dangers found on peaks and shores, eager to prove themselves against new and even mightier foes.', 'They stop for nothing, not even the end of a battle.', "Those with the ability to change their nature survived Phyrexia's biological attacks. Everything else died.", 'Twilight falls. We rise.\\n—Necropolis inscription', "Under Yavimaya's peaceful facade beat the hearts of many savage beasts.", "Unlike many hunters, these panthers have no need for camouflage. They're fast enough to catch any prey.", 'Urza convinced many Dominarians not only to set aside their differences, but to embrace them.', 'Urza knew Phyrexians would come through the air and sent his soldiers to greet them.', 'Whether for good or ill, their arrival always means change.', "Young tower drakes quickly learn to maneuver among Benalia's many spires."]
artist: ['Aaron Boyd', 'Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Alan Rabinowitz', 'Alton Lawson', 'Andrew Goldhawk', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Ben Thompson', 'Bradley Williams', 'Brom', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Ciruelo', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'D. J. Cleland-Hura', 'Dan Frazier', 'Dana Knutson', 'Dany Orizio', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Dorman', 'David Day', 'David Martin', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Don Hazeltine', 'Donato Giancola', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Douglas Shuler', 'Edward P. Beard, Jr.', 'Eric Peterson', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Gary Ruddell', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Hannibal King', 'Heather Hudson', 'Jacques Bredy', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jerry Tiritilli', 'John Avon', 'John Howe', 'John Matson', 'Ken Meyer, Jr.', 'Kev Walker', 'Larry Elmore', 'Luca Zontini', 'Marc Fishman', 'Mark Brill', 'Mark Romanoski', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Massimilano Frezzato', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Mike Ploog', 'Mike Raabe', 'Nelson DeCastro', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pete Venters', 'Quinton Hoover', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Ray Lago', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Rob Alexander', 'Roger Raupp', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Sam Wood', 'Scott Bailey', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Stephanie Law', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas Gianni', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tom Wänerstrand', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Val Mayerik', 'Wayne England', 'rk post']
