rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\'t have to find the card if you don\'t want to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This spell doesn\'t resolve and you get no Saprolings if the enchantment is an illegal target on resolution."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'A permanent which is of multiple colors counts as each of its colors.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'All the creature cards enter the battlefield simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'For purposes of ordering any continuous effects of the creatures, the current player (not the controller of this spell) decides the ordering regardless of which player is putting the creatures onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Alters all occurrences of the chosen word in the text box and the type line of the given card.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can target a card with no appropriate words on it, or even one with no words at all.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Changing the text of a spell will not allow you to change the targets of the spell because the targets were chosen when the spell was cast. The text change will (probably) cause it to be countered since the targets will be illegal.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you change the text of a spell which is to become a permanent, the permanent will retain the text change until the effect wears off.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can be used to change a land’s type from one basic land type to another. For example, Forest can be changed to Island so it produces blue mana. It doesn’t change the name of any permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can’t change a word to the same word. It must be a different word.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It only changes what is printed on the card (or set on a token when it was created or set by a copy effect). It will not change any effects that are on the permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t change proper nouns (i.e. card names) such as “Island Fish Jasconius”.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the words to change on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'An empty library will have no card to reveal, so a player with an empty library has no card to compare. The effect looks for the highest cost card of the cards that actually are revealed.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can change all, some, or none of the targets.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t change the number of targets, choose an illegal target, or make something get targeted more than once.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrifice of a land is part of the cost of casting Harrow. You can\'t pay this cost more than once to get a multiple effect."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The two lands do not count toward your normal one land you can play each turn.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have more than one of these on the battlefield, you get to use them all and you don’t skip multiple draw steps.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The “if you do” means “if you search your library”. You get to skip your draw step and shuffle your deck even if you don’t find (or choose not to find) a basic land.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The land does not count toward your normal limit of playing one land per turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If the target land is an illegal target when Frenzied Tilling tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t search your library for a basic land card.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Being untapped is a targeting restriction. If the target is tapped before this spell resolves, then this spell doesn’t resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Being “without flying” is a targeting restriction. The ability won’t resolve if the target gains flying before the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can affect basic or non-basic types, but it must be for a specific type. The chosen type must be an existing land type. See the glossary of the comprehensive rulebook for more details on existing land types.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Cost modifiers which add a cost are not restricted to only white mana.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Spending only white mana applies to the ability regardless of which mode you choose.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Counterspells can be cast that target it, but when they resolve they simply don’t counter it since it can’t be countered.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can be targeted while on the stack. Shroud only works while it is on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Counterspells can be cast that target it, but when they resolve they simply don’t counter it since it can’t be countered.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The new color replaces all previous colors.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Counterspells can be cast that target it, but when they resolve they simply don’t counter it since it can’t be countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Counts plains controlled by all opponents.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Does give itself Trample, but does not give itself a +1/+1 counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Does not affect cards on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the player has no cards in their hand, you still get to look through their deck, but you do not get to exile any cards.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It exiles the chosen card plus all others in the hand, library, and graveyard. Some people thought the chosen card was not exiled due to some vague wording.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You only get to pick one card from the player’s hand.'}, {'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'The copies must be found if they are in publicly viewable zones. Finding copies while searching private zones is optional.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Does not affect the first spell cast each turn.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a spell’s color was changed while on the stack, use the color at the time it was when you started announcement, not as it currently is on the stack or as it was at the time it resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Alloy Golem phases out, you do not pick a new color when it phases in.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a land counts as multiple basic land types, you can choose it for either or for both of those land types.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'You sacrifice all lands other than the chosen ones. Since you can only choose lands with basic land types, any non-basic lands that don’t have a basic land type (even if they have some other land type, as in the case of Cloudpost) are necessarily going to be sacrificed.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If attached to an opponent’s creature, only you can activate the ability to return it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If it somehow blocks multiple creatures in a single combat, the triggered ability only triggers once.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the Kavu Titan was kicked, it enters the battlefield with trample and will keep this ability until it leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the Pouncing Kavu is kicked, it enters the battlefield with haste and will keep this ability until it leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the targeted creature card in the graveyard is removed before resolution, this spell won’t resolve since its only target will be invalid.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can cast this spell when you have no creature card in your hand. If this happens, simply ignore that part of the spell. You still put the graveyard creature onto the battlefield and still return it to your hand at the beginning of the end step.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You must have a creature in your graveyard to cast this spell since it requires a valid target.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you change the color of a spell which is to become a permanent, the permanent will retain the color change until the end of the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It affects Elves controlled by all players, not just yours.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'This card is now an Elf but has been reworded so that it does not give itself the bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can enchant a permanent that is not red or green, but it doesn’t do anything in that case.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It counts all opponents’ swamps.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It identifies the creatures that are not going to untap at the time this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is possible to activate this ability in response to itself and generate some odd combinations. For example, if you control this card and another creature, you can use this card’s ability and target the creature you control. You can then use this card’s ability again and target a creature your opponent controls. The second usage resolves first and you get your opponent’s creature in exchange for this one. The first usage then resolves and swaps your other creature for the Infiltrator so you get it back. The net effect is that you can swap any creature you have for any of theirs if you can pay this ability twice. Note that your opponent does get the chance to use the Infiltrator if they have the mana in between your two usages and can mess you up.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'There is no effect if the same player controls both creatures when it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It means “a black or green creature other than itself attacks”.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It will exile itself if it is going to the graveyard from the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The cards in your graveyard are not considered to be in your hand for any reason. For example, you can’t discard them.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You count spells that were cast this turn before this card enters the battlefield. (The Invasion FAQ is not correct on this point.)'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Making a permanent colorless does not make it into an artifact.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Must be used before blockers are declared in order to affect blocking decisions. You can’t wait to see what your opponent declares and then try to stop them.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can use it after combat or even on a creature which can’t possibly block this turn because it’s that player’s turn to attack, but it generally has no effect other than to let you draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Only affects creatures you control when this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Shackles does not tap the creature when it enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Stops the player from playing a land, but not from putting a land onto the battlefield using a spell or ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability affects all players.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability deals one damage even if the land produces no mana when it was tapped to use a mana ability. This can happen with lands that produce a variable amount of mana.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card’s ability is a mana ability. There is no chance to respond to it in order to prevent the damage. If you want to prevent the damage, you need to use a prevention spell or ability prior to tapping the land for mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature returns after “at the beginning of the end step” abilities trigger, so any such abilities on the creature will not trigger this turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The extra 2 mana to cast it as an instant does not count as part of the mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The first ability only affects creatures you control at the time the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The “if you do” means “if you choose to reveal cards”. You still shuffle if you have no creature card in your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This does not change the amount of mana gained. It just makes all the mana generated by the basic land be of a single color of your choice.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose a different color each time a basic land is tapped.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose the same color or mana the land would normally produce.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This does not count as your one land you can normally play each turn.'}, {'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not preventing damage since it does not use the word “prevent”. It is a replacement.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This spell is countered and you get no Saprolings if the artifact is an illegal target on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Will give 1 life for each black mana used, but not more life than the amount of unprevented damage that is dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Will not tap a creature that is both white and another color.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can activate the ability in response to itself and get more than one creature card onto the battlefield before this returns to its owner’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can activate the ability that grants shroud in response to this card being targeted by a spell or ability. If you do so, then (if this is the spell or abilities only target) the spell or ability won’t resolve since this card will now be an illegal target.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can cast this and choose to target zero creatures and effectively just draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the color during resolution. This means your opponent does not get to react after knowing the color you chose.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the color on resolution. Your opponent does not get to respond between the color choice and the damage happening. They need to use any damage prevention they want before you choose a color.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the order on the bottom of your library.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'A number of nonbasic lands have basic land types. Domain abilities don’t count the number of lands you control — they count the number of basic land types among lands you control, even if that means checking the same land twice. For example, if you control a Tundra, an Overgrown Tomb, and a Madblind Mountain, you’ll have a Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest among the lands you control. Your domain abilities will be maxed out.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'How many lands you control of a particular basic land type is irrelevant to a domain ability, as long as that number is greater than zero. As far as domain is concerned, ten Forests is the same as one Forest.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'To determine the number of basic land types among lands you control, look at the lands you have on the battlefield and ask yourself whether the subtypes Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest appear within that group. The number of times you say yes (topping out at five) tells you how powerful your domain abilities will be.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If the Prison Barricade is kicked, it enters the battlefield with the ability to attack as if it did not have Defender and will keep this ability until it leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'The destroy ability only works on legendary creatures, not on other legendary permanents.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-01-01', 'text': 'If none of the targeted spell’s targets is a land when Teferi’s Response would resolve, Teferi’s Response doesn’t resolve due to having no legal targets.'}, {'date': '2006-01-01', 'text': 'Remember that a spell only targets something if it is an Aura or uses the phrase “target” in its text.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When Coalition Victory resolves, it checks for the five basic land types (Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, Forest) and the five colors (white, blue, black, red, green). If a single land has multiple types and/or a single creature is multiple colors, it will count all those types and/or colors.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-10-15', 'text': 'Will not add or remove the supertype snow to or from a land.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can’t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Domain abilities count the number of basic land types among lands you control, not how many lands you control or how many of any type.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The basic land types are Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. Land types other than basic land types (such as Desert) don’t contribute to domain abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'You draw a card regardless of whether the targeted spell was countered or {1} was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The player chooses which one to sacrifice as the spell resolves. If only one of the targets is still legal at that time, then the player must choose that one to sacrifice.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'Creatures which enter the battlefield (or cards which become creatures) after the beginning of combat ability resolves are not placed in either pile. Since they weren’t in the chosen pile, they won’t be able to attack.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If you have two of these, then you will separate the creatures into piles twice, and the opponent will choose a pile each time. Only creatures that were in both of the chosen piles can attack.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'The effect is best understood if you read it as “creatures not in the chosen pile can’t attack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'This is a mana ability, which means it can be activated as part of the process of casting a spell or activating another ability. If that happens you get the mana right away, but you don’t get to look at the drawn card until you have finished casting that spell or activating that ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'This is not a mana ability. It uses the stack, and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You get the mana whether you want it or not. If you don’t spend it, it will disappear at the end of the current step (or phase).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'A number of nonbasic lands have basic land types. Domain abilities don’t count the number of lands you control — they count the number of basic land types among lands you control, even if that means checking the same land twice. For example, if you control a Tundra, an Overgrown Tomb, and a Madblind Mountain, you’ll have a Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest among the lands you control. Your domain abilities will be maxed out.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'How many lands you control of a particular basic land type is irrelevant to a domain ability, as long as that number is greater than zero. As far as domain is concerned, ten Forests is the same as one Forest.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'To determine the number of basic land types among lands you control, look at the lands you have on the battlefield and ask yourself whether the subtypes Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest appear within that group. The number of times you say yes (topping out at five) tells you how powerful your domain abilities will be.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Angelic Shield goes to the graveyard when you activate the ability, but the targeted creature does not get returned until the ability resolves. All your creatures lose the bonus while the ability is on the stack which may result in the targeted creature being destroyed before the return can take effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'First, the card is discarded. Then, in turn order, each player is given the option to pay 5 life. Then, if no player paid 5 life, the card is put onto the battlefield from the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The card is actually discard, so anything which triggers on a discard will trigger. Such abilities will wait to go on the stack until after this ability has completely resolved.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If the target card is no longer in the graveyard when Cremate tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'You must be able to target a card in a graveyard to cast Cremate.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'A mana ability is an ability that (1) isn’t a loyalty ability, (2) doesn’t target, and (3) could put mana into a player’s mana pool when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell or activating an ability, the new top card won’t be revealed until you finish casting that spell or activating that ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this as normal during your main phase, it will enter the battlefield and you’ll receive priority. If no abilities trigger because of this, you can activate its ability immediately, before any other player has a chance to remove it from the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Verdeloth won’t give himself +1/+1 unless he somehow becomes a Saproling.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-09-20', 'text': 'If a turn has multiple combat phases, this spell can be cast during any of them as long as it’s after the beginning of that phase’s Declare Blockers Step.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If Armadillo Cloak enchants a creature you don’t control, you’ll gain life when it deals damage, as long as that damage hasn’t already caused you to lose the game.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'While Armadillo Cloak’s last ability is similar to lifelink, it isn’t lifelink—it’s a normal triggered ability. If a creature you control with lifelink wears an Armadillo Cloak and deals damage, first you’ll gain that much life for lifelink, and then Armadillo Cloak’s triggered ability is put onto the stack. This also means that multiple instances of Armadillo Cloak’s triggered ability do trigger separately.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target when Annihilate tries to resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The target player is chosen as you announce Void, but the number isn’t chosen until it’s resolving. No player may choose to take actions between you choosing a number and the rest of Void’s effects.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'You can choose 0. Artifact lands and most tokens have mana values of 0, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Aggressive Urge tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Skizzik’s ability checks at each end step whether it was kicked while it was being cast. You don’t have to pay its kicker cost each turn (and can’t do so, even if you really want to kick it again).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Urza\'s Rage. When that spell or ability resolves, Urza\'s Rage won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target for Urza\'s Rage becomes an illegal target, the spell won\'t resolve and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard with no effect. This is true even if its damage can\'t be prevented and even though it can\'t be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Exclude can target a creature spell that can\'t be countered. When Exclude resolves, that spell won\'t be countered, but you\'ll still draw a card."}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Dismantling Blow tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw two cards if it was kicked. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do draw two cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Domain abilities count the number of basic land types among lands you control, not how many lands you control or how many of any type.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The basic land types are Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. Land types other than basic land types (such as Desert) don’t contribute to domain abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Domain abilities count the number of basic land types among lands you control, not how many lands you control or how many of any type.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The basic land types are Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. Land types other than basic land types (such as Desert) don’t contribute to domain abilities.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "A spell that can\'t be countered is a legal target for Absorb. The spell won\'t be countered when Absorb resolves, but you\'ll still gain 3 life."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Piles may be empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You choose whether to pay {2}{G} as Rith’s ability resolves. Once you make that choice, no player may take actions until the Saprolings are created (if you paid) and the ability has finished resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You must sacrifice the creature if you still control it as the delayed triggered ability resolves.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Crosis\' Leibdiener", \'text\': "{1}, opfere Crosis\' Leibdiener: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um {U}{B}{R}.", \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'„Crosis ist das Auge des Urdrachen, das Täuschung und Dunkelheit durchdringt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=183723&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8d9e64b-4557-4485-933b-aa32632a6a7e\', \'multiverseId\': 183723}, \'multiverseid\': 183723}, {\'name\': \'Asistente de Crosis\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85e67dd2-31fa-4914-82ac-c655e64fcf30\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Serviteur de Crosis\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrifiez le Serviteur de Crosis : Ajoutez {U}{B}{R} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "« Crosis est l\'œil de l\'ur-dragon, perçant l\'illusion et l\'obscurité. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=185597&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2eb42b-cae3-4d32-92ab-e3aa08c24c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 185597}, \'multiverseid\': 185597}, {\'name\': \'Servitore di Crosis\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19fe11d9-b8bd-40ff-9543-39dd7d4d89f2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'クローシスの従者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f01afd49-d4b6-4056-a96c-d2bd762b1c1e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Assessor de Crosis\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77b9ae53-c7ef-4778-aa38-d1267ae510c4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': "Darigaaz\' Atem", \'text\': "Bonus {2} (Du kannst zusätzlich {2} bezahlen, wenn Du diesen Zauberspruch spielst.)\\nDarigaaz\' Atem fügt jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur und jedem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Wenn Du die Bonuskosten bezahlt hast, fügt Darigaaz\' Atem stattdessen jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur und jedem Spieler 4 Schadenspunkte zu.", \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=183556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0919181d-3c7c-4cb6-bf09-82db0f2d7dc7\', \'multiverseId\': 183556}, \'multiverseid\': 183556}, {\'name\': \'Aliento de Darigaaz\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9647a885-6369-466d-bc6d-d86ba4bcdb8f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Souffle de Darigaaz\', \'text\': \'Kick {2} (Vous pouvez payer {2} supplémentaires quand vous jouez ce sort.)\\nLe Souffle de Darigaaz inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature sans le vol et à chaque joueur. Si vous avez payé le coût de kick, le Souffle de Darigaaz inflige 4 blessures à chaque créature sans le vol et à chaque joueur à la place.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=185430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'613dae00-3f0e-4be6-ba57-12c9d3de1386\', \'multiverseId\': 185430}, \'multiverseid\': 185430}, {\'name\': \'Soffio di Darigaaz\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aa01a8b-b959-48dd-ac37-e033b0368eb8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'デアリガズの息\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'269eb5db-8ccd-48bb-8635-becdbc4fde3c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bafo de Darigaaz\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecfa76e7-f298-47b8-a432-8bd3d1c6dab1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': "Darigaaz\' Leibdiener", \'text\': "{1}, opfere Darigaaz\' Leibdiener: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um {B}{R}{G}.", \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'„Darigaaz ist der Atem des Urdrachen, der die Last der Sterblichkeit wegbrennt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=183724&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10a87cab-8764-46dc-aad3-337e81e10a2e\', \'multiverseId\': 183724}, \'multiverseid\': 183724}, {\'name\': \'Asistente de Darigaaz\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce6b44a-0644-49e4-af76-09e5093e2e3d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Serviteur de Darigaaz\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrifiez le Serviteur de Darigaaz: Ajoutez {B}{R}{G} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "« Darigaaz est le souffle de l\'ur-dragon, consumant les fardeaux des mortels. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=185598&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e69107dd-262c-43d7-91b9-3da290311418\', \'multiverseId\': 185598}, \'multiverseid\': 185598}, {\'name\': \'Servitore di Darigaaz\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c90875f2-6fb4-41e6-9e3c-279a1da0e3b9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'デアリガズの従者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb11d12b-9508-406a-be9e-fe6f669fd674\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Assessor de Darigaaz\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55011abb-b746-4f6c-993c-a5c1e5030fe0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absorbieren\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch Deiner Wahl. Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine Siegessicherheit wird Dein Untergang sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=183644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'301e43c7-c5fe-497f-9998-328815a96ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 183644}, \'multiverseid\': 183644}, {\'name\': \'Absorber\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a529ac-2014-4ab8-b4c8-87671b3408c3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Absorption\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Votre présomption entraînera votre chute. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=185518&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7576126-2ca4-4963-aefd-a6596f2dd101\', \'multiverseId\': 185518}, \'multiverseid\': 185518}, {\'name\': \'Assorbire\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23395357-0b68-4a78-bfff-1275fc28724d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'吸収\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05ea8304-5c00-4bb9-9e9a-a4a6c2cfcdfa\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Absorver\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10ae76f7-9322-4e2e-8bf8-6793e35d0914\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aggressiver Drang\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Macht der Wildnis, in einem einzelnen Ansturm gebündelt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=183599&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c761927b-abf4-41ec-bbd6-1ff83c44eda4\', \'multiverseId\': 183599}, \'multiverseid\': 183599}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Agresivo\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8280510-bdd6-4c0c-89ef-f2f270451438\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Pulsion agressive\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La force de la nature, brute, violente, concentrée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=185473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3681f8a-2279-4c99-b9fb-cea8b322da1e\', \'multiverseId\': 185473}, \'multiverseid\': 185473}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Aggressivo\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beaeb450-cb2c-4794-850e-c1953547a249\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'攻撃的衝動\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb8b740-ffe6-4757-a10c-c0bea19a5b1d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ímpeto Agressivo\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52e2741-923e-4601-af1f-9f36fcea555c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Aggressiver Kavu', 'text': 'Bonus {4} (Du kannst zusätzlich {4} bezahlen, wenn Du diesen Zauberspruch spielst.)\\nDer Aggressive Kavu kann nicht blocken.\\nWenn Du die Bonuskosten bezahlt hast, kommt der Aggressive Kavu mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Kavu', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=183566&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7aff2c29-95af-4d86-82ba-e1b503bf67ec', 'multiverseId': 183566}, 'multiverseid': 183566}, {'name': 'Kavu Agresor', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6630b713-ea62-4511-9537-060220dd1474'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Kavru agresseur', 'text': 'Kick {4} (Vous pouvez payer {4} supplémentaires quand vous jouez ce sort.)\\nLe Kavru agresseur ne peut pas bloquer.\\nSi vous avez payé le coût de kick, le Kavru agresseur arrive en jeu avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.', 'type': 'Créature : kavru', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=185440&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abe37f51-a514-49f3-b28a-9c7e7272799d', 'multiverseId': 185440}, 'multiverseid': 185440}, {'name': 'Aggressore Kavu', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '412a83a4-f530-4bf7-8237-4cf8c6f7dd43'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'カヴーの攻め手', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce5264b9-4727-42d5-8082-15204c8895a5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Agressor Kavu', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ccbc6f56-541b-424f-a24a-9b7b4970f6dd'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Alabaster-Egel\', \'text\': \'Weiße Zaubersprüche, die Du spielst, kosten {W} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Egel\', \'flavor\': \'„Seine Steine scheinen heilende Kräfte zu besitzen, aber sie zu entfernen ist ein sehr mühseliger Prozeß." —Tolarianische Forschungsergebnisse\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=183419&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f544a335-55c3-459d-9f58-383bfe580450\', \'multiverseId\': 183419}, \'multiverseid\': 183419}, {\'name\': \'Sanguijuela de Alabastro\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3640409f-2ec2-4299-be31-ceabe4ab940d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Sangsue d\'albâtre", \'text\': \'Les sorts blancs que vous jouez coûtent {W} de plus à jouer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sangsue\', \'flavor\': \'« Ses pierres semblent servir à la guérison, mais les retirer intactes est un processus épuisant. » — Notes scientifiques, Tolaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=185293&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f7cd88-8b0a-4f74-aee2-54f05b345978\', \'multiverseId\': 185293}, \'multiverseid\': 185293}, {\'name\': \'Sanguisuga di Alabastro\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfal