T: Put a basic land card from your hand into play.', "o\\nG, oc\\nT: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\no\\nU, oc\\nT: Put target creature you control on top of its owner's library.", "o\\nGo\\nG, oc\\nT: Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.\\no\\nUo\\nU, oc\\nT: Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'o\\nRo\\nR, oc\\nT: Thornscape Master deals 2 damage to target creature.\\no\\nWo\\nW, oc\\nT: Target creature gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', "o\\nU, oc\\nT: Put target creature you control on top of its owner's library.\\no\\nR, oc\\nT: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.", "o\\nUo\\nU, oc\\nT: Gain control of target Legend or legendary permanent. (This effect doesn't end at end of turn.)", "o\\nUo\\nU, oc\\nT: Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\no\\nRo\\nR, oc\\nT: Nightscape Master deals 2 damage to target creature.", 'o\\nW, Sacrifice an enchantment: Destroy target enchantment.\\no3o\\nUoo\\nU Counter target enchantment spell.', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Tap target creature.', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Tap target creature.\\no\\nB, oc\\nT: Target player loses 1 life.', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Tap target creature.\\no\\nR, oc\\nT: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', 'o\\nWo\\nW, oc\\nT: Target creature gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\no\\nBo\\nB, oc\\nT: Target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'o\\nX, oc\\nT: Choose one Prevent the next X damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn; or you gain X life. Spend only white mana this way.', 'oc\\nT, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nB or o\\nR to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG or o\\nW to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nR or o\\nG to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nU or o\\nB to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nW or o\\nU to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\no4o\\nR, oc\\nT, Sacrifice a creature: Keldon Necropolis deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Archaeological Dig: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', "oc\\nT: Destroy target creature if it shares a color with the most common color among all permanents or the color tied for most common. A creature destroyed this way can't be regenerated.", 'oc\\nT: Llanowar Vanguard gets +0/+4 until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.\\noc\\nT: Samite Archer deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'oc\\nT: Search your library for a Legend or legendary card, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'oc\\nT: Target creature becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Target land becomes a swamp until end of turn.', 'oo\\nB Cinder Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\no\\nR, Sacrifice Cinder Shade: Cinder Shade deals damage equal to its power to target creature.', "oo\\nB Hooded Kavu can't be blocked this turn except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.", 'oo\\nB Regenerate Metathran Zombie.', 'oo\\nG Target creature blocks Rampant Elephant this turn if able.', 'oo\\nG Viashino Grappler gains trample until end of turn.', "oo\\nR Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\noo\\nR Return Crown of Flames to its owner's hand.", 'oo\\nR Firescreamer gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'oo\\nR Serpentine Kavu gains haste until end of turn. (It may attack and oc\\nT the turn it comes under your control.)', "oo\\nW Attacking doesn't cause Llanowar Cavalry to tap this turn."]
